    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d157">

                <pb facs="0238" n="972" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg972"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Sill to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Seoul</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-11-10"><hi rendition="#italic">November 10,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Japan will restore status, using temporary force if approved foreign powers.
                    Russian Government has telegraphed approval. Answer is expected from others. I
                    hope you will approve. Answer by telegraph.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sill.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
